{"b":2,"c":22,"v":[[2,[["Speak unto Aaron and to his sons, that they separate themselves from the holy things of the children of Israel, and that they profane not my holy name in those things which they hallow unto me: I am the LORD.",[[2,22,3],[2,22,4],[2,22,5],[2,22,6],[2,15,31],[3,6,3],[3,6,4],[3,6,5],[3,6,6],[3,6,7],[3,6,8]]],["that they profane not",[[2,22,32],[2,18,21],[2,19,12],[2,20,3],[2,21,6]]],["hallow",[[1,13,12],[1,28,38],[3,18,32],[4,15,19]]]]],[3,[["having his uncleanness upon him",[[2,7,20],[2,7,21]]],["from my",[[1,33,14],[1,33,15],[18,16,11],[18,51,11],[39,25,41],[52,1,9]]]]],[4,[["a leper",[[2,13,2],[2,13,3],[2,13,44],[2,13,45],[2,13,46]]],["running issue",[[2,15,2],[2,15,3]]],["holy things",[[2,2,3],[2,2,10],[2,6,25],[2,6,26],[2,6,27],[2,6,28],[2,6,29],[2,21,22],[3,18,9],[3,18,19]]],["until",[[2,14,2],[2,14,3],[2,14,4],[2,14,5],[2,14,6],[2,14,7],[2,14,8],[2,14,9],[2,14,10],[2,14,11],[2,14,12],[2,14,13],[2,14,14],[2,14,15],[2,14,16],[2,14,17],[2,14,18],[2,14,19],[2,14,20],[2,14,21],[2,14,22],[2,14,23],[2,14,24],[2,14,25],[2,14,26],[2,14,27],[2,14,28],[2,14,29],[2,14,30],[2,14,31],[2,14,32],[2,15,13],[2,15,14],[2,15,15]]],["unclean",[[2,21,1],[3,19,11],[3,19,12],[3,19,13],[3,19,14],[3,19,15],[3,19,16]]],["whose",[[2,15,16]]]]],[5,[["whosoever",[[2,11,24],[2,11,43],[2,11,44]]],["or a man",[[2,15,7],[2,15,19]]]]],[6,[["The soul which hath touched any such shall be unclean until even, and shall not eat of the holy things, unless he wash his flesh with water.",[[2,11,24],[2,11,25],[2,15,5],[2,16,24],[2,16,25],[2,16,26],[2,16,27],[2,16,28],[3,19,7],[3,19,8],[3,19,9],[3,19,10],[36,2,13],[45,6,11],[57,10,22]]]]],[7,[["And when the sun is down, he shall be clean, and shall afterward eat of the holy things; because it is his food.",[[2,21,22],[3,18,11],[3,18,12],[3,18,13],[3,18,14],[3,18,15],[3,18,16],[3,18,17],[3,18,18],[3,18,19],[4,18,3],[4,18,4],[45,9,4],[45,9,13],[45,9,14]]]]],[8,[["That which dieth of itself, or is torn with beasts, he shall not eat to